{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"89210d18-b9e7-402d-aa3c-62be4ecfb674","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Inline Plan\n1. `models.py`: Copy `Role.parents` to an independent `tuple(self.parents)` in `__post_init__`.\n2. `matcher.py`: Implement `valid_resource` checking string type, non-empty, no leading/trailing `/`, split by `/` with non-empty segments not in `(\".\", \"..\")` and strictly matching `^[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+$`.\n3. `matcher.py`: Implement `matches(pattern, resource)` returning `False` unless `valid_resource(resource)` and `isinstance(pattern, str)`; allow `\"*\"`, valid literal exact match, or trailing `\"/*\"` where prefix is a valid resource and `resource.startswith(prefix + \"/\")`.\n4. `audit.py`: Remove `if not decision.allowed: return` in `AuditLog.record` so all decisions (allow and deny) are recorded.\n5. `policy_engine.py`: In `resolve_roles`, skip already-visited roles (`name in resolved`) to break inheritance cycles; in `decide`, check `any(r.effect == \"deny\" for r in matching)` -\u003e `Decision(False, \"explicit_deny\")`, else `any(r.effect == \"allow\" ...)` -\u003e `Decision(True, \"allow\")`, else `Decision(False, \"no_matching_allow\")`.\n\n\nAll requirements and edge-case invariants have been repaired and verified across [models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-012_35476_1795488385840_icm_v3/models.py), [matcher.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-012_35476_1795488385840_icm_v3/matcher.py), [audit.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-012_35476_1795488385840_icm_v3/audit.py), and [policy_engine.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-012_35476_1795488385840_icm_v3/policy_engine.py).\n","duration_seconds":80.4692946,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":42822,"output_tokens":5360,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":156377,"total_tokens":48182}}}
